## Findings
Plan 1 step 1 (kubernetes): Confirm the Pod's current status, restart count, and last termination state (exit code, reason, start/finish times) for the app container.
- Pod s1-app-5468546b65-dvgq5 in demo-s1 is in Running phase but not Ready (ContainersNotReady). [ev_6fbf4102f4]
- The app container is in Waiting state with reason CrashLoopBackOff (back-off 40s restarting failed container). [ev_6fbf4102f4]
- The app container has restart_count 3. [ev_6fbf4102f4]
- The app container's last termination state is terminated with reason Error, exit_code 2, started_at 2026-10-19T22:33:11Z and finished_at 2026-10-19T22:33:11Z. [ev_6fbf4102f4]
- The app container image is docker.io/library/bianque-s1-app:dev. [ev_6fbf4102f4]

Plan 1 step 2 (kubernetes): Identify the Deployment that owns the Pod and its current replica/ready state.
- Pod s1-app-5468546b65-dvgq5 in demo-s1 is owned by ReplicaSet s1-app-5468546b65 (kind ReplicaSet), not directly by a Deployment. [ev_ec1761dee2]
- A second pod s1-app-666f75b99-nlpbt in demo-s1 is owned by ReplicaSet s1-app-666f75b99 and is Running/Ready 1/1 with 0 restarts. [ev_ec1761dee2]
- No Deployment named s1-app exists in namespace demo-s1 (k8s_get_deployment returned not_found). [ev_ba75b9a23d]
- The Deployment that owns ReplicaSet s1-app-5468546b65 could not be identified; the Deployment name is unknown from available evidence. [ev_ec1761dee2, ev_ba75b9a23d]

Plan 1 step 3 (kubernetes): Find events describing the restart loop (e.g. Back-off restarting failed container, probe failures, OOM kills).
- No events could be retrieved for namespace demo-s1: k8s_list_events returned not_found for the namespace, both with and without an involved_object filter. [ev_1230c1d488]
- The restart-loop events (Back-off restarting failed container, liveness probe failures, OOMKilled) could not be obtained; the events API returned not_found for namespace demo-s1. [ev_1230c1d488]

Plan 1 step 4 (logs): Read the log of the previous (crashed) attempt of the app container to find the error before exit.
- The previous (crashed) instance log for container app in pod demo-s1/s1-app-5468546b65-dvgq5 is not available (not_found). [ev_1230c1d488]
- The current instance log for container app in pod demo-s1/s1-app-5468546b65-dvgq5 is also not available (not_found). [ev_1230c1d488]
