- k8s_list_events returned not_found for namespace demo-s1, both with an involved_object filter for pod s1-app-5468546b65-dvgq5 and without any filter. [ev_1230c1d488]
- No events (Back-off restarting failed container, liveness/readiness probe failures, or OOMKilled) could be obtained for pod s1-app-5468546b65-dvgq5; the events API returned not_found for namespace demo-s1. [ev_1230c1d488]

Plan 2 step 3 (change): Identify the Deployment owning ReplicaSet s1-app-5468546b65 and its rollout/revision history to find the change that introduced the failure.
- The alert identifies pod s1-app-5468546b65-dvgq5 in namespace demo-s1, container app, as restarting (CrashLoopBackOff). [ev_1230c1d488]
- The ReplicaSet name s1-app-5468546b65 follows the <deployment>-<hash> convention, implying the owning Deployment is named s1-app in namespace demo-s1. [ev_1230c1d488]
- change_get_rollout_history for deployment s1-app in namespace demo-s1 returned 'not_found: replicasets demo-s1', so no rollout/revision history could be retrieved. [ev_1230c1d488]
- change_list_commits returned 'not_found: repository' with and without a path filter, so no commit history could be retrieved. [ev_1230c1d488]
- The Deployment name, revision history, and the manifest/commit diff that changed the app container image or configuration could not be obtained; the root cause of the change is unknown from the available evidence. [ev_1230c1d488]

